1
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:38,920
ADAPTED FROM <i>JIA JIN CHAI</i>, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:55,120
That old lady went to
do laundry with the kids.

4
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,200
They won't be back until dusk.

5
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:00,480
Plus, she is having a high fever.

6
00:02:01,080 --> 00:02:02,440
She can't get out of bed at all.

7
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:05,240
You can practically do anything to her.

8
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:14,560
- Is my gambling debt settled now?
- Get lost!

9
00:02:15,840 --> 00:02:17,640
We have a deal!

10
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,080
Who are you?

11
00:02:29,680 --> 00:02:31,160
I'm your husband.

12
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:33,360
For once, your gambler
of a father did not lie.

13
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:35,320
You are in fact a belle.

14
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:37,160
Today is my lucky day, then.

15
00:02:40,640 --> 00:02:43,160
Somebody! Help!

16
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,600
How could you do this?

17
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:47,120
Why would you sell your kind daughter off?

18
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:48,240
- Money!
- Do you know what you're doing?

19
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:50,680
Whoever pays me 300 coins

20
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:53,560
gets to be my son-in-law.

21
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:56,160
300 coins.

22
00:02:56,240 --> 00:02:57,800
- Only 300 coins.
- Have you no conscience?

23
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:01,920
Be nice. Just give in,
and you won't suffer much.

24
00:03:02,520 --> 00:03:03,520
Understand?

25
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,200
What's happening?

26
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:16,960
Help!

27
00:03:17,560 --> 00:03:18,400
You wench.

28
00:03:18,480 --> 00:03:21,120
I'll skin you alive.

29
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:22,440
- I'll sell your sick mother
- Help.

30
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:24,520
and your sister to the brothel.

31
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:26,120
They will never to rise again,

32
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:28,800
trodden underfoot by thousands.

33
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:38,360
Touch me and you'll wish you were dead.

34
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:59,320
- It's so quiet in there.
- Suddenly, it's silent.

35
00:03:59,400 --> 00:04:00,400
What is going on?

36
00:04:00,480 --> 00:04:02,000
Can you go in and check?

37
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:08,320
She's out.

38
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,320
So much blood.

39
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,440
So much blood.

40
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:12,000
She killed him?

41
00:04:16,200 --> 00:04:17,160
Pa.

42
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:20,079
Your 300 coins.

43
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:26,120
- It's a head!
- Oh my!

44
00:04:46,280 --> 00:04:48,760
No, none of them is like her at all.

45
00:04:48,840 --> 00:04:49,880
Take them away.

46
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,440
Move.

47
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:52,920
Move.

48
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:54,480
Forgive me.

49
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:57,760
I told you to find a person,
and this is what you got for me?

50
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:59,040
Look at them.

51
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,240
None of them is as alluring as Rao.

52
00:05:00,320 --> 00:05:02,560
It's difficult to find
another beautiful woman

53
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,400
like Lady Rao in
the capital on short notice.

54
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:07,000
I have visited every corner,

55
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:08,360
and they are the ones
who resemble her the most.

56
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:11,960
Their eyes or manners
are quite similar to hers.

57
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:14,720
- Perhaps you can take another look?
- How ridiculous.

58
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:17,360
You're foolish and blind.

59
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:19,680
Rao is an unrivaled beauty.

60
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:21,040
A true gem.

61
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:23,040
The creatures
you found are nothing like her.

62
00:05:23,120 --> 00:05:24,160
Right, right.

63
00:05:24,240 --> 00:05:25,600
I'll look for more.

64
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:28,640
Execute her!

65
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:30,680
‪-Throw it at her.
‪-Stone her to death.

66
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:32,000
- What is the ruckus?
- Stone her to death.

67
00:05:32,080 --> 00:05:33,880
Acting in self-defense
is enough to acquit her.

68
00:05:33,960 --> 00:05:35,280
Why did they sentence her to death?

69
00:05:35,360 --> 00:05:36,600
- Murderer!
- You're a murderer!

70
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:38,120
That's unjust.

71
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:39,360
Justice?

72
00:05:39,440 --> 00:05:41,040
The dead man owned a gambling den.

73
00:05:41,120 --> 00:05:42,840
He was a great bully.

74
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:47,560
I was told he spent a lot of money
to hire a thug to…

75
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:48,480
Enough!

76
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,800
- Murderer!
- Poor thing.

77
00:05:49,880 --> 00:05:50,720
- What a tragedy.
- Move aside.

78
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:52,000
- Don't make things up.
- Don't make things up.

79
00:05:52,080 --> 00:05:53,120
Murderer.

80
00:05:53,640 --> 00:05:54,480
Murderer.

81
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:55,640
Throw it at her!

82
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,680
Murderer!

83
00:05:58,280 --> 00:06:01,040
- Throw it at her.
- Throw it at her.

84
00:06:02,680 --> 00:06:04,160
Murderer!

85
00:06:05,320 --> 00:06:06,240
Throw it at her.

86
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:08,640
- Throw it at her.
- Stone her to death.

87
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:11,000
- Stone her to death.
- Stone her to death.

88
00:06:11,080 --> 00:06:12,400
An eye for an eye.

89
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,640
- Die!
- Go.

90
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,840
Find out the background
of the female prisoner

91
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:19,000
- and the crime she committed.
- Throw it at her.

92
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:21,680
- Now!
- Of course.

93
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:24,560
Murderer.

94
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:26,480
Luck is on my side.

95
00:06:26,560 --> 00:06:28,280
- You deserve death!
- Throw it at her.

96
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:31,000
Luck really is on my side.

97
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:35,360
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

98
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:39,840
- Hurry, this way.
- Okay.

99
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:15,280
Why did you kidnap me?

100
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:18,760
Wash her. Then, I'll take a closer look.

101
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:21,720
- Yes.
- Come. Quick.

102
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,360
What are you doing?

103
00:07:24,240 --> 00:07:25,080
What are you doing?

104
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:26,920
What do you want?

105
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,240
Clean her up.

106
00:07:28,320 --> 00:07:29,920
Don't touch me!

107
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:35,320
You are right, Madam.

108
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:36,760
According to our law,

109
00:07:36,840 --> 00:07:38,800
women who acted in
self-defense during rape

110
00:07:38,880 --> 00:07:40,320
will be given 40 lashes.

111
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,840
Their family can also pay
a fine in lieu of the sentence.

112
00:07:43,720 --> 00:07:47,040
However, she is poor, so
she was given a death sentence.

113
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,640
I went to the court
office with my name token

114
00:07:48,720 --> 00:07:50,480
and lied that she was my rogue servant.

115
00:07:50,560 --> 00:07:53,040
I claimed that the rapist
was trying to damage our property.

116
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:56,040
Besides, the Luo family
had moved away overnight.

117
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:59,320
The magistrate knew
he had meted out an unfair judgment,

118
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:00,640
so he didn't do much to stop me.

119
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:04,760
I got her with just a few golden zhus.

120
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:07,480
Good. You did well.

121
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:10,880
First Madam, you can't enter.

122
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:12,440
Madam!

123
00:08:14,360 --> 00:08:16,520
Yufeng, what brought you here?

124
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:24,520
You brought someone in this late at night.

125
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,840
Is it something you're trying to hide?

126
00:08:28,040 --> 00:08:30,520
Let's speak outside.

127
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:35,400
We can do it here.

128
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:57,560
You have always
been very observant, Yufeng.

129
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:59,440
We can never hide
anything from you in this household.

130
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:02,160
I never intended to keep this from you.

131
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:04,640
Allow me to explain.

132
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:05,840
Spare me.

133
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:08,920
I know what you're up to.

134
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:12,720
You ought to know
that the Lus helped found our nation.

135
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:15,400
They are a prestigious family,

136
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:18,080
not a family that has fallen from grace.

137
00:09:18,160 --> 00:09:22,480
They will not be puppeteered by anyone.

138
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:25,720
Your plan is way too bold.

139
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:27,920
Calm down, Yufeng.

140
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:29,960
As the saying goes,

141
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:33,720
only a ruthless man can achieve greatness.

142
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:36,880
They forced Rao
to marry someone who is as good as dead,

143
00:09:36,960 --> 00:09:38,440
making her a widow for a lifetime.

144
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:41,240
It's only fair for
us to retaliate in kind.

145
00:09:42,160 --> 00:09:43,560
Among the four sons of the Duke,

146
00:09:43,640 --> 00:09:45,680
three fell on the battlefield.

147
00:09:45,760 --> 00:09:47,760
One is a cripple.

148
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:50,360
Lu Zhuo is
the only pillar in their family.

149
00:09:51,120 --> 00:09:52,280
With him gone,

150
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:55,880
the Lu family is just a toothless tiger

151
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:58,280
whose bite can never hurt.

152
00:09:58,360 --> 00:09:59,920
Don't you agree, Yufeng?

153
00:10:13,120 --> 00:10:15,760
Moreover,
worried that Rao will be affected

154
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:18,880
by the reputation
of her birth mother, Zhou,

155
00:10:19,560 --> 00:10:21,920
Mother rarely allows
Rao out all these years.

156
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,640
Not many people have seen her.

157
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:26,440
Besides, the Lu
family is quite preoccupied

158
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:27,880
with internal and external conflicts.

159
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:30,680
They have no time to verify her identity.

160
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:34,920
Once the marital rites
have been carried out,

161
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:38,640
it'll be too late to change anything.

162
00:10:39,800 --> 00:10:43,440
But what if Lu Zhuo survives?

163
00:10:44,920 --> 00:10:46,080
Impossible.

164
00:10:46,160 --> 00:10:48,880
Seven imperial physicians
in the Imperial Medical Bureau affirm

165
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:51,400
that he will die soon.

166
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:58,080
It will take a huge miracle
for him to survive.

167
00:10:58,760 --> 00:11:02,200
Then, after a year or two,
when things have settled down,

168
00:11:02,280 --> 00:11:06,360
we'll marry Rao off somewhere far away
as our adopted daughter.

169
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:09,400
Now that's better than
being a widow for the rest of her life.

170
00:11:11,280 --> 00:11:13,040
I see.

171
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:15,000
You've always been stubborn.

172
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:17,240
I can't talk you out of anything.

173
00:11:18,960 --> 00:11:20,960
Show her to me.

174
00:11:21,560 --> 00:11:23,080
If she doesn't look like her,

175
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:25,040
your plan will not work anyway.

176
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:27,600
Bring her out.

177
00:11:35,320 --> 00:11:36,880
Lift your head.

178
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,400
Who are you?

179
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:55,520
What do you think?

180
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:59,520
Even you are taken aback, aren't you?

181
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:04,120
She's as close as one could get.

182
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:07,240
After we doll her up a little,

183
00:12:07,960 --> 00:12:10,400
no one will be able to tell them apart.

184
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:17,120
Yufeng.

185
00:12:17,200 --> 00:12:18,480
Are you all right?

186
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,720
You look distraught.

187
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,240
So similar.

188
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:28,440
So similar.

189
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:31,480
But

190
00:12:32,360 --> 00:12:34,280
she's a bit too tanned.

191
00:12:35,800 --> 00:12:37,520
Her mannerisms

192
00:12:38,600 --> 00:12:41,240
need to be refined as well.

193
00:12:44,800 --> 00:12:48,320
This chamber is damp and stuffy.
It makes me sick.

194
00:12:49,520 --> 00:12:52,760
I will head back now. Do what you must.

195
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:54,600
Yufeng,

196
00:12:56,680 --> 00:13:00,600
please don't tell anyone about this.

197
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:04,200
If Mother finds out,
the plan will fall apart.

198
00:13:22,320 --> 00:13:23,960
A lowly prisoner on death row.

199
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:25,840
Shouldn't you kneel before me?

200
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:30,880
Madam, you went out of your way
to save someone on death row.

201
00:13:32,280 --> 00:13:34,320
You certainly need something
important from me.

202
00:13:35,040 --> 00:13:37,000
It is you who seeks a favor.

203
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:39,080
You should be

204
00:13:40,280 --> 00:13:41,280
the one who kneels.

205
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:44,840
- Insolent!
- Wait.

206
00:13:48,320 --> 00:13:49,720
I love your audacity.

207
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:53,560
It seems like I found the right person.

208
00:13:55,440 --> 00:13:56,520
Yes.

209
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:59,440
I need you to do something for me.

210
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,680
Do it well,

211
00:14:03,440 --> 00:14:06,440
and you'll have a life of wealth.

212
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:09,200
Fail

213
00:14:09,880 --> 00:14:11,640
and you'll see the guillotine.

214
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:17,520
In that case,

215
00:14:18,040 --> 00:14:20,760
a life of wealth is a faraway ideal

216
00:14:21,440 --> 00:14:23,080
that I must achieve by risking my life.

217
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:26,640
I have to do everything,
but I might end up with nothing.

218
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:28,680
This won't work.

219
00:14:29,520 --> 00:14:32,760
Just send me back to the guillotine.

220
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:34,320
Wait.

221
00:14:34,840 --> 00:14:35,880
You…

222
00:14:37,560 --> 00:14:39,000
What else do you want?

223
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:43,160
Madam, you're back.

224
00:14:45,080 --> 00:14:48,600
Madam, what did I do this time?

225
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:49,720
GOVERNESS CHANG

226
00:14:52,280 --> 00:14:53,440
Search her residence.

227
00:14:57,000 --> 00:15:00,920
Will you give me what I want?

228
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,760
Gold or silver

229
00:15:07,960 --> 00:15:09,200
at your disposal.

230
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:12,240
You are affluent and powerful.

231
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:16,600
Something only
a prisoner on death row can do

232
00:15:17,400 --> 00:15:19,080
must be something extremely dangerous.

233
00:15:23,240 --> 00:15:24,560
I want to see my parents

234
00:15:25,520 --> 00:15:28,080
and 50,000 coins.

235
00:15:29,280 --> 00:15:32,360
What? 50,000 coins?

236
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:35,080
Greedy, aren't you?

237
00:15:35,160 --> 00:15:38,480
50,000 coins is enough
to buy 10 beautiful entertainers.

238
00:15:41,520 --> 00:15:44,000
I'm stupid, clumsy, and can't dance.

239
00:15:45,240 --> 00:15:47,640
Perhaps you can ask
the entertainers to do the job.

240
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:48,600
You…

241
00:15:54,800 --> 00:15:56,160
Fine.

242
00:15:57,080 --> 00:15:58,880
It's nothing.

243
00:15:59,400 --> 00:16:00,600
You'll have it.

244
00:16:01,600 --> 00:16:02,720
Guards!

245
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:04,600
Take her away.

246
00:16:04,680 --> 00:16:09,280
Have her properly perfumed.
Get that stink of poverty off her.

247
00:16:15,760 --> 00:16:17,440
I didn't do it, Madam.

248
00:16:19,600 --> 00:16:20,800
Madam.

249
00:16:20,880 --> 00:16:23,280
I didn't do it.

250
00:16:23,360 --> 00:16:26,520
I have served you half my life.

251
00:16:26,600 --> 00:16:29,000
Why won't you trust me?

252
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:40,600
Madam.

253
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:45,080
I carry out your orders dutifully.

254
00:16:45,160 --> 00:16:47,640
Some wicked gossip mongers

255
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:50,280
must have plotted to make you doubt me.

256
00:16:50,360 --> 00:16:51,480
Smash it open.

257
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:01,960
It was I who poured in

258
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:06,760
the boiling quick lime back then.

259
00:17:07,359 --> 00:17:10,680
In an instant, the body dissolved.

260
00:17:10,760 --> 00:17:11,599
It was so scary!

261
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:14,119
If it weren't for this piece of evidence,

262
00:17:14,640 --> 00:17:17,319
I would have died unjustly!

263
00:17:26,599 --> 00:17:28,760
You have followed me for a long time.

264
00:17:28,840 --> 00:17:30,280
Of course, I trust you.

265
00:17:31,040 --> 00:17:32,560
I just need

266
00:17:33,360 --> 00:17:34,840
reassurance.

267
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:37,040
Thank you, Madam.

268
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:42,720
<i>Could this just be a coincidence?</i>

269
00:17:50,120 --> 00:17:51,680
Crying? Why are you crying?

270
00:17:52,280 --> 00:17:54,440
We have found ourselves a generous donor.

271
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:55,760
50,000 coins!

272
00:17:56,560 --> 00:17:58,960
Your flesh and bones

273
00:17:59,040 --> 00:18:00,520
won't even get me 10 coins.

274
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:04,480
I sold myself to the Wei family.

275
00:18:05,040 --> 00:18:06,440
From now on,
you won't be my parents anymore.

276
00:18:07,240 --> 00:18:09,840
We might not see each other again.

277
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:14,840
I would like
to speak to Mother in private.

278
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:16,920
Sure.

279
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:18,880
Go ahead.

280
00:18:18,960 --> 00:18:20,000
I'll just count my coins.

281
00:18:28,160 --> 00:18:30,200
An indenture is not worth 50,000 coins.

282
00:18:30,280 --> 00:18:32,920
You can't take the money.

283
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:50,200
Ma.

284
00:18:50,880 --> 00:18:52,000
From now on,

285
00:18:52,920 --> 00:18:54,600
I won't be able to look after you.

286
00:18:55,280 --> 00:18:57,400
Please lead a good life
with my brothers and sisters.

287
00:18:58,840 --> 00:19:00,360
Forget I ever existed.

288
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:03,560
I don't need it. Keep it for yourself.

289
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:12,600
We have to be there
before dawn. It's time to go.

290
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:23,560
It's time to go. Come now.

291
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:29,760
Go.

292
00:19:34,960 --> 00:19:36,440
Let's go.

293
00:19:36,520 --> 00:19:38,560
They even gave me
a plot of land to manage.

294
00:19:38,640 --> 00:19:40,360
We're going to be rich.

295
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:44,400
Our daughter is having a comfortable life.
What's there to worry about? Let's go.

296
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:46,120
My daughter.

297
00:19:47,040 --> 00:19:47,920
My daughter.

298
00:19:54,560 --> 00:19:55,440
My daughter.

299
00:20:11,280 --> 00:20:14,880
FIVE DAYS LATER

300
00:20:17,840 --> 00:20:19,440
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

301
00:20:52,120 --> 00:20:53,520
I am Lu Ya from the Duke's Residence,

302
00:20:54,120 --> 00:20:55,600
here to pick up
the bride on behalf of my brother.

303
00:20:55,680 --> 00:20:56,560
FOWL OF PROSPERITY

304
00:20:56,640 --> 00:20:59,120
Bride, please enter the carriage.

305
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:03,320
LU YA, ELDEST SON OF
THE SECOND WIFE OF THE DUKE OF YING

306
00:21:10,440 --> 00:21:12,360
Mother, the auspicious hour is upon us.

307
00:21:12,960 --> 00:21:15,080
Time to have Rao
get into the horse carriage.

308
00:21:18,080 --> 00:21:19,560
Wait.

309
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:22,960
Look. A carriage from Lady Shou'an.

310
00:21:23,560 --> 00:21:24,600
Who is Lady Shou'an?

311
00:21:24,680 --> 00:21:26,920
The distant grandmother of the bride.

312
00:21:31,080 --> 00:21:32,760
I told you not to tell her.

313
00:21:32,840 --> 00:21:33,680
Why did she come?

314
00:21:34,360 --> 00:21:37,080
You think you can hide
everything just because you want to?

315
00:21:38,360 --> 00:21:40,280
LADY SHOU'AN

316
00:21:53,000 --> 00:21:56,040
Old Madam Wei, you sure

317
00:21:56,120 --> 00:21:59,360
have picked a great suitor for Rao.

318
00:22:01,360 --> 00:22:03,960
Do not look around. It is unbecoming.

319
00:22:05,520 --> 00:22:07,040
We should have sent someone to greet you.

320
00:22:07,120 --> 00:22:09,760
Why don't we speak inside?

321
00:22:12,320 --> 00:22:15,040
A coward who's too gutless to do anything.

322
00:22:16,040 --> 00:22:20,080
What? Afraid that others
would think you sell your niece off

323
00:22:20,160 --> 00:22:21,560
to please the Duke?

324
00:22:22,520 --> 00:22:24,880
Or do you fear the pointing fingers

325
00:22:24,960 --> 00:22:26,880
that you can't even
protect the only daughter

326
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:28,000
of your younger brother?

327
00:22:28,600 --> 00:22:30,880
The marriage between
both families has long been arranged.

328
00:22:30,960 --> 00:22:34,080
The heir to the Duke of Ying is handsome

329
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:36,040
and is a protector of the nation.

330
00:22:36,120 --> 00:22:40,520
If my granddaughter can bring them
peace and prosperity,

331
00:22:40,600 --> 00:22:42,840
or even cure my grandson-in-law,

332
00:22:43,520 --> 00:22:45,080
that's her honor.

333
00:22:47,360 --> 00:22:48,640
Do not interrupt us.

334
00:23:00,560 --> 00:23:02,080
Mother had to make difficult decisions.

335
00:23:02,160 --> 00:23:03,880
Lady Shou'an, you accused her wrongly

336
00:23:03,960 --> 00:23:05,320
without knowing the full story.

337
00:23:05,400 --> 00:23:07,960
We are part of a bigger family.

338
00:23:08,040 --> 00:23:09,560
Lest the outsiders gossip about us,

339
00:23:10,320 --> 00:23:13,520
I invite you to talk in
private inside the house.

340
00:23:14,320 --> 00:23:15,640
No need.

341
00:23:15,720 --> 00:23:17,960
We are no longer a family.

342
00:23:18,040 --> 00:23:21,480
I came here today
to give my granddaughter some gifts.

343
00:23:27,440 --> 00:23:29,160
As per His Majesty's decree,

344
00:23:29,240 --> 00:23:30,840
EARL OF CHENG'AN'S RESIDENCE

345
00:23:30,920 --> 00:23:33,280
"Lu Zhuo, the heir to the Duke of Ying,

346
00:23:33,360 --> 00:23:36,480
is a valiant warrior

347
00:23:36,560 --> 00:23:39,160
who has protected
our society from invaders.

348
00:23:39,760 --> 00:23:42,000
The daughter of the Earl of Cheng'an

349
00:23:42,080 --> 00:23:45,040
is a prestigious woman of virtues

350
00:23:45,120 --> 00:23:48,440
and embodies the morals of feminine codes.

351
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:53,440
To extend my well wishes
for their eternal union,

352
00:23:54,040 --> 00:23:57,320
the bride shall be bestowed
a set of golden crowns and hairpins,

353
00:23:57,400 --> 00:23:59,320
and one crimson ritual garment.

354
00:23:59,920 --> 00:24:02,320
These gifts will exalt
the bride's virtue and worthiness

355
00:24:02,400 --> 00:24:05,400
and honor the loyalty of
our valiant defender of the realm."

356
00:24:06,480 --> 00:24:09,000
Thank you, Your Majesty.

357
00:24:15,960 --> 00:24:17,480
It is indeed a golden crown.

358
00:24:18,080 --> 00:24:19,080
No one can wear it

359
00:24:19,160 --> 00:24:21,760
except for the Empress Dowager,
the Empress, and the consorts.

360
00:24:21,840 --> 00:24:24,840
So someone in the palace
is voicing support for the daughter.

361
00:24:25,440 --> 00:24:27,600
Wear the crown and lift the fan!

362
00:24:27,680 --> 00:24:28,920
Please don't do it!

363
00:24:30,560 --> 00:24:32,240
Greetings, Lady Shou'an.

364
00:24:32,760 --> 00:24:33,920
I believe the groom

365
00:24:34,680 --> 00:24:37,440
should be the one to remove the fan.

366
00:24:39,160 --> 00:24:42,720
Him? He's in bed, unconscious.

367
00:24:42,800 --> 00:24:43,640
How can he lift the fan?

368
00:24:44,760 --> 00:24:45,760
Just back off.

369
00:25:02,640 --> 00:25:04,920
You're worried it's bad luck too, right?

370
00:25:07,200 --> 00:25:11,160
Fine. I won't remove your fan.

371
00:25:11,880 --> 00:25:13,160
I'll walk you to the carriage.

372
00:25:20,920 --> 00:25:22,120
Grandmother.

373
00:25:23,960 --> 00:25:25,120
Good girl.

374
00:25:42,760 --> 00:25:43,640
<i>Wei Rao.</i>

375
00:25:44,360 --> 00:25:47,240
<i>You're so lucky to have grandparents</i>

376
00:25:47,320 --> 00:25:48,760
<i>who care so much about you.</i>

377
00:25:49,400 --> 00:25:52,720
<i>Allow me to repay their kindness</i>
<i>on your behalf.</i>

378
00:26:06,040 --> 00:26:10,000
MAY JOY ALWAYS FIND YOU
MAY WE NEVER BE FORGOTTEN TO EACH OTHER

379
00:26:18,760 --> 00:26:20,840
<i>The Weis and the Lus have</i>
<i>long had a marital arrangement.</i>

380
00:26:21,480 --> 00:26:23,440
<i>The groom is heavily injured and</i>
<i>needs a celebration to turn his luck over.</i>

381
00:26:24,240 --> 00:26:28,120
<i>That said, Wei Rao has given her heart</i>
<i>to her childhood playmate and cousin.</i>

382
00:26:28,200 --> 00:26:30,560
<i>She refuses to marry into the Lu family.</i>

383
00:26:30,640 --> 00:26:32,480
<i>I bought you for 50,000 coins.</i>

384
00:26:32,560 --> 00:26:35,360
<i>If Lu Zhuo lives,</i>
<i>you can enjoy a comfortable life.</i>

385
00:26:35,440 --> 00:26:39,000
<i>If he dies, you'll deal</i>
<i>with the hardship alone.</i>

386
00:26:39,080 --> 00:26:43,320
<i>From now on, fate will decide your life.</i>
<i>You have no one to blame.</i>

387
00:26:43,400 --> 00:26:44,320
A-Chou,

388
00:26:46,000 --> 00:26:47,360
from now on,

389
00:26:48,040 --> 00:26:50,520
you are Lady Wei Rao,

390
00:26:50,600 --> 00:26:52,760
the new bride of
the Duke of Ying's family.

391
00:26:56,320 --> 00:26:59,840
You are Wei Rao.

392
00:27:08,800 --> 00:27:10,240
What are you doing?

393
00:27:10,320 --> 00:27:11,320
Come in here.

394
00:27:17,960 --> 00:27:19,560
How dare you?

395
00:27:19,640 --> 00:27:22,120
If someone recognizes you,
our plan will be ruined.

396
00:27:22,200 --> 00:27:23,480
She is wearing my golden crown!

397
00:27:24,880 --> 00:27:26,800
And she is the new bride
of the Duke of Ying's family.

398
00:27:26,880 --> 00:27:30,320
But I have to hide myself from everyone.

399
00:27:31,160 --> 00:27:32,120
It's so unfair.

400
00:27:33,200 --> 00:27:36,320
A lowly woman gets to enjoy nobility

401
00:27:36,840 --> 00:27:38,840
and a life of abundance for nothing.

402
00:27:38,920 --> 00:27:42,400
Everything in this life
comes with a price.

403
00:27:43,240 --> 00:27:46,920
The heir was seriously injured
while he served our nation.

404
00:27:47,760 --> 00:27:51,200
The bride
comes from a miserable background.

405
00:27:52,560 --> 00:27:56,040
Instead of turning the luck around,
she might worsen it.

406
00:27:56,120 --> 00:27:59,320
Then, in grief and sorrow,

407
00:27:59,400 --> 00:28:03,000
she might follow her husband's
footsteps by hanging herself.

408
00:28:03,600 --> 00:28:05,280
That's normal, isn't it?

409
00:28:05,960 --> 00:28:07,120
In the end,

410
00:28:07,200 --> 00:28:10,240
it makes our family look good.

411
00:28:11,400 --> 00:28:13,120
So you already have a plan, Aunt?

412
00:28:13,200 --> 00:28:14,600
I do everything for you.

413
00:28:15,200 --> 00:28:17,240
Of course, I know what you want.

414
00:28:17,840 --> 00:28:19,160
You're not one

415
00:28:20,120 --> 00:28:23,320
to allow others to
take your spot and glory.

416
00:28:32,120 --> 00:28:33,120
However,

417
00:28:33,800 --> 00:28:36,280
you must bear with me for the moment.

418
00:28:36,800 --> 00:28:38,920
There are many eyes back home.

419
00:28:39,440 --> 00:28:42,320
You should stay in
our secondary residence for now.

420
00:28:43,040 --> 00:28:45,800
In case of over hearing,

421
00:28:46,320 --> 00:28:48,480
when you go out, don't go by the name Rao.

422
00:28:50,080 --> 00:28:51,920
What should I call myself then?

423
00:28:56,880 --> 00:28:57,720
Jundai.

424
00:28:59,000 --> 00:29:00,240
Jundai it is.

425
00:29:01,240 --> 00:29:02,720
Jundai.

426
00:29:05,960 --> 00:29:07,800
I like the sound of it.

427
00:29:07,880 --> 00:29:09,760
I can't wait to see

428
00:29:10,960 --> 00:29:13,840
how that lowly woman will fare.

429
00:29:16,080 --> 00:29:18,800
FIVE DAYS AGO

430
00:29:25,400 --> 00:29:27,640
HONGXIAN, A-CHOU'S YOUNGER SISTER

431
00:29:33,520 --> 00:29:35,680
Ma, I need to use the toilet.

432
00:29:36,640 --> 00:29:37,680
Me too.

433
00:29:37,760 --> 00:29:38,600
RUNSHENG, A-CHOU'S YOUNGER BROTHER

434
00:29:38,680 --> 00:29:39,960
Halt!

435
00:29:41,560 --> 00:29:43,160
My daughter needs to use the loo.

436
00:29:43,240 --> 00:29:44,760
Can we stop in front?

437
00:29:45,600 --> 00:29:47,600
Besides, it's quite warm.

438
00:29:47,680 --> 00:29:49,600
You two can rest and have some cold tea.

439
00:29:49,680 --> 00:29:50,760
It won't take too long.

440
00:29:51,560 --> 00:29:53,000
Come. Halt.

441
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:03,000
Over here.

442
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:16,320
Superintendent Jin, have some tea.

443
00:30:17,520 --> 00:30:18,520
Here you go.

444
00:30:18,600 --> 00:30:19,720
Thanks.

445
00:30:36,920 --> 00:30:39,520
Ma, at night, sleep with one eye open.

446
00:30:40,240 --> 00:30:41,960
If the journey leads to somewhere
more and more remote,

447
00:30:42,480 --> 00:30:44,000
they might be up to something.

448
00:30:45,560 --> 00:30:48,480
Your asthma medicine
contains henbane flower.

449
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:50,720
It has a soporific effect.

450
00:30:51,440 --> 00:30:54,440
Mix it with tea
and feed it to the coachmen.

451
00:30:55,280 --> 00:30:56,320
Let's go.

452
00:31:13,720 --> 00:31:14,560
Let's go.

453
00:31:28,600 --> 00:31:30,160
Wake up. Those three ran away.

454
00:31:30,840 --> 00:31:32,560
Who? Who ran away?

455
00:31:33,400 --> 00:31:34,480
It's almost dawn.

456
00:31:35,160 --> 00:31:36,040
It's too late.

457
00:31:36,640 --> 00:31:37,800
Get rid of the guy first.

458
00:31:37,880 --> 00:31:39,920
<i>We'll bury him in</i>
<i>the woods and report back.</i>

459
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:41,600
<i>Don't tell anyone about this.</i>

460
00:31:43,200 --> 00:31:45,280
Think you can get 50,000 coins for free?

461
00:31:45,360 --> 00:31:47,160
That's the worth of your entire family.

462
00:31:52,880 --> 00:31:56,480
SONGYUE HALL, DUKE'S RESIDENCE

463
00:32:08,080 --> 00:32:09,520
<i>So, he is Lu Zhuo.</i>

464
00:32:14,000 --> 00:32:15,040
The heir is sick.

465
00:32:15,120 --> 00:32:16,840
The marital rites had to be simplified.

466
00:32:16,920 --> 00:32:17,800
I hope you don't mind.

467
00:32:18,840 --> 00:32:21,600
Old Madam is afraid that having
his mother here will only upset her.

468
00:32:21,680 --> 00:32:23,800
So she is receiving guests
at the banquet hall now.

469
00:32:23,880 --> 00:32:25,400
But Old Madam is also
aware that it's your first time here,

470
00:32:25,480 --> 00:32:27,080
so she asks me to keep you company here.

471
00:32:27,160 --> 00:32:29,720
You may let me know if you need anything.

472
00:32:29,800 --> 00:32:30,640
KONG YINGSHU
FOURTH DAUGHTER-IN-LAW AT DUKE'S RESIDENCE

473
00:32:30,720 --> 00:32:32,160
I am the heir's Fourth Aunt.

474
00:32:32,880 --> 00:32:34,160
Greetings, Fourth Aunt.

475
00:32:35,360 --> 00:32:37,600
It is warm tonight.

476
00:32:37,680 --> 00:32:38,760
Why are you wearing gloves?

477
00:32:52,320 --> 00:32:54,080
I was careless in my needlework

478
00:32:54,600 --> 00:32:56,960
and pricked myself while
I was getting ready for the marriage.

479
00:32:57,040 --> 00:32:58,680
My hands are full of scars.

480
00:32:58,760 --> 00:33:00,040
I am embarrassed to show them.

481
00:33:00,640 --> 00:33:01,880
That's why I wear gloves.

482
00:33:03,240 --> 00:33:04,560
I see.

483
00:33:05,160 --> 00:33:07,080
I was told that your name is Rao.

484
00:33:07,160 --> 00:33:08,520
I shall call you Rao then.

485
00:33:09,440 --> 00:33:10,840
Lu Zhuo is still unconscious.

486
00:33:10,920 --> 00:33:13,320
Allow me to lift
the fan veil on his behalf.

487
00:33:14,280 --> 00:33:15,560
Thank you, Fourth Aunt.

488
00:33:24,720 --> 00:33:25,760
Oh my.

489
00:33:25,840 --> 00:33:27,320
You're so pretty.

490
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:31,120
They say a beautiful woman can turn
a cold cell into a gilded hall.

491
00:33:31,920 --> 00:33:34,440
Seeing what you look like now,

492
00:33:34,520 --> 00:33:38,320
even a gilded hall
cannot outshine your charm.

493
00:33:43,480 --> 00:33:47,720
Unfortunately,
the heir won't see it tonight.

494
00:33:50,800 --> 00:33:52,960
It's all right, Fourth Aunt.

495
00:33:53,040 --> 00:33:54,800
The heir is a blessed man.

496
00:33:54,880 --> 00:33:56,000
He will recover one day.

497
00:33:56,760 --> 00:33:58,560
I hope he wakes up soon.

498
00:33:58,640 --> 00:34:02,880
He will be over the moon when he sees
how beautiful his wife is.

499
00:34:04,120 --> 00:34:05,480
Oh, Governess Miao.

500
00:34:07,280 --> 00:34:08,719
Greetings, Madam.

501
00:34:09,239 --> 00:34:12,000
This is Governess Miao,
Mother's confidant.

502
00:34:12,080 --> 00:34:14,320
If you ever need anything,

503
00:34:14,400 --> 00:34:18,560
or if your servant is disrespecting you,
just go to her.

504
00:34:23,440 --> 00:34:26,360
<i>Someone sent by the Duchess?</i>

505
00:34:26,440 --> 00:34:28,600
<i>She's clearly here to</i>
<i>take over Songyue Hall.</i>

506
00:34:28,679 --> 00:34:30,920
Grandmother sure
has thought of everything.

507
00:34:31,880 --> 00:34:33,600
The heir is sick,

508
00:34:33,679 --> 00:34:34,960
and I'm young and inexperienced.

509
00:34:36,199 --> 00:34:38,080
I shall learn from you, Governess Miao.

510
00:34:38,159 --> 00:34:40,000
Once I'm familiar with everything,

511
00:34:40,080 --> 00:34:41,400
I'll care for the heir myself,

512
00:34:42,000 --> 00:34:43,880
that Governess may be spared the hardship.

513
00:34:44,800 --> 00:34:48,159
I will do my best to assist you, Madam.

514
00:34:48,239 --> 00:34:50,360
They are all aware of Lu Zhuo's condition,

515
00:34:50,440 --> 00:34:52,159
so they won't disturb you tonight.

516
00:34:52,800 --> 00:34:54,800
You have had an eventful day,
so you must be tired.

517
00:34:54,880 --> 00:34:55,719
Rest now.

518
00:34:56,320 --> 00:34:58,440
You can
greet the elderly tomorrow morning.

519
00:34:59,000 --> 00:34:59,840
I shall take my leave now.

520
00:35:01,400 --> 00:35:02,600
Take care, Fourth Aunt.

521
00:35:09,040 --> 00:35:09,920
Madam,

522
00:35:10,440 --> 00:35:13,960
allow me to lead
your servants to settle down.

523
00:35:14,480 --> 00:35:16,480
No need for that.

524
00:35:16,560 --> 00:35:18,520
Madam is used to my and Bitao's service.

525
00:35:18,600 --> 00:35:19,440
GOVERNESS WU

526
00:35:19,520 --> 00:35:21,480
We cannot be away from her.

527
00:36:12,800 --> 00:36:15,880
Thanks to your quick wit, Madam.
You had already prepared your answer

528
00:36:15,960 --> 00:36:17,480
and cleared Fourth Madam's doubts.

529
00:36:18,000 --> 00:36:21,120
This almond whitening ointment
can rejuvenate skin.

530
00:36:21,640 --> 00:36:25,360
In a fortnight,
your hands will be smooth and spotless.

531
00:36:27,200 --> 00:36:28,880
How is that enough?

532
00:36:28,960 --> 00:36:31,520
You have done hard labor.

533
00:36:31,600 --> 00:36:34,560
You're nothing like a noble lady.

534
00:36:34,640 --> 00:36:36,600
Since it's your first time
in a prestigious family,

535
00:36:36,680 --> 00:36:38,480
there are many rules you don't know.

536
00:36:38,560 --> 00:36:40,000
Keep your mouth shut if you can.

537
00:36:40,760 --> 00:36:42,800
I can be your messenger.

538
00:36:42,880 --> 00:36:44,600
Speak more, and you might slip up.

539
00:36:44,680 --> 00:36:46,400
And if you slip up,

540
00:36:46,480 --> 00:36:48,160
the Earl's reputation will be ruined,

541
00:36:48,760 --> 00:36:51,160
even we servants would get dragged down.

542
00:36:51,760 --> 00:36:55,600
That Governess Miao
is obviously an informant planted here.

543
00:36:56,640 --> 00:36:58,320
You have a special identity.

544
00:36:58,400 --> 00:37:00,480
Having outsiders here
will just add unnecessary risks.

545
00:37:00,560 --> 00:37:02,760
You should remove them
as soon as possible.

546
00:37:03,360 --> 00:37:05,280
<i>Seems to me you're the informant.</i>

547
00:37:07,200 --> 00:37:08,040
I've grown weary.

548
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:10,240
We can talk tomorrow.

549
00:37:11,360 --> 00:37:12,760
Governess Wu, stay here.

550
00:37:12,840 --> 00:37:14,360
Attend the patient for his needs.

551
00:37:14,440 --> 00:37:15,680
What?

552
00:37:15,760 --> 00:37:18,000
First Madam assigned me here

553
00:37:18,080 --> 00:37:20,520
to teach you how to run a household
and how to act like a lady.

554
00:37:20,600 --> 00:37:23,880
I… There's no way I can tend to the sick.

555
00:37:25,840 --> 00:37:27,400
If you can't handle such a small thing,

556
00:37:28,520 --> 00:37:30,320
don't stand there then.

557
00:37:30,400 --> 00:37:31,560
Find someone who can.

558
00:37:32,160 --> 00:37:33,640
I… You…

559
00:37:37,800 --> 00:37:41,080
I will do as Madam says.
I shall take my leave now.

560
00:37:41,160 --> 00:37:45,360
BLISS

561
00:37:47,320 --> 00:37:49,400
Bitao, prepare me for bed.

562
00:37:53,240 --> 00:37:54,200
Is that how you say it?

563
00:37:55,360 --> 00:37:57,080
Yes, My Lady. You're so smart.

564
00:38:42,680 --> 00:38:45,320
It seems like fate hates you.

565
00:38:45,400 --> 00:38:47,040
It turns you into a living corpse,

566
00:38:48,320 --> 00:38:52,040
and even gives you
a night soil collector as your wife.

567
00:38:54,880 --> 00:38:56,360
A poor woman from a humble family

568
00:38:56,880 --> 00:38:59,120
and a noble gentleman.

569
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:01,320
It feels like a dream.

570
00:39:07,440 --> 00:39:09,120
I've spent five days
practicing the etiquette.

571
00:39:09,760 --> 00:39:11,320
I cannot afford to slip up.

572
00:39:17,480 --> 00:39:18,600
Lord Lu.

573
00:39:19,320 --> 00:39:21,040
You are handsome,

574
00:39:21,120 --> 00:39:24,360
but you are gravely ill and emaciated.

575
00:39:24,880 --> 00:39:26,320
It makes you less attractive.

576
00:39:28,480 --> 00:39:31,160
Please turn around,
for your face might frighten me at night.

577
00:39:32,800 --> 00:39:35,440
I know you can't move. Let me

578
00:39:36,120 --> 00:39:37,400
help you.

579
00:40:45,520 --> 00:40:47,520
<i>You want to break off our engagement?</i>

580
00:40:48,280 --> 00:40:50,120
In your dreams.

581
00:40:50,200 --> 00:40:52,520
<i>You say I'm as venomous as a snake?</i>

582
00:40:52,600 --> 00:40:53,440
<i>How pitiful.</i>

583
00:40:54,040 --> 00:40:56,600
You are destined to share a bed with one,

584
00:40:56,680 --> 00:41:00,200
and you'll never escape
me for as long as you live.

585
00:41:17,960 --> 00:41:19,240
You're awake?

586
00:41:20,400 --> 00:41:21,640
Get away from me.

587
00:41:22,360 --> 00:41:23,360
What?

588
00:41:24,920 --> 00:41:26,160
Get away from my bed.

589
00:41:32,800 --> 00:41:33,680
Someone!

590
00:41:34,560 --> 00:41:36,840
Someone! The heir is awake!

591
00:41:37,680 --> 00:41:38,960
Someone!

592
00:41:39,040 --> 00:41:41,440
The heir is awake! Someone!

593
00:41:42,240 --> 00:41:43,560
- His Lordship.
- His Lordship.

594
00:41:46,640 --> 00:41:48,000
Quick.

595
00:41:48,080 --> 00:41:51,480
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

596
00:41:51,560 --> 00:41:54,840
- His Lordship is awake.
- His Lordship is awake.

597
00:41:55,400 --> 00:41:56,600
How wonderful.

598
00:42:24,760 --> 00:42:26,960
<i>Does Lu Zhuo</i>
<i>hold any grudges against Wei Rao?</i>

599
00:42:27,680 --> 00:42:29,200
<i>He looks at me as if I were a beast.</i>

600
00:42:30,840 --> 00:42:33,520
His Lordship's pulse is steady.
He is in good health.

601
00:42:33,600 --> 00:42:35,680
He is one lucky soul.

602
00:42:36,200 --> 00:42:37,920
However, he still needs to convalesce.

603
00:42:38,000 --> 00:42:39,080
All right.

604
00:42:39,160 --> 00:42:41,480
He woke up. Let's speak outside.

605
00:42:42,440 --> 00:42:43,440
Great news.

606
00:42:45,280 --> 00:42:46,120
Come, Physician Zhao.

607
00:42:52,520 --> 00:42:55,520
The toxin is still inside him,
but he is no longer in danger.

608
00:42:56,400 --> 00:42:58,480
His Lordship just needs to rest.

609
00:42:58,560 --> 00:43:00,200
I'll write up
a medicinal diet prescription.

610
00:43:00,280 --> 00:43:02,240
His Lordship hasn't eaten for a long time.

611
00:43:02,320 --> 00:43:05,320
He needs to have many small meals
over the day to regain his vigor.

612
00:43:06,080 --> 00:43:09,440
Once he is nourished,
his body will become strong again.

613
00:43:09,520 --> 00:43:12,360
The residual toxin will not hurt him.

614
00:43:12,440 --> 00:43:16,200
Physician Zhao,
you have saved my grandson.

615
00:43:16,720 --> 00:43:19,360
Once Lu Zhuo makes a full recovery,
I'll have him thank you in person.

616
00:43:20,080 --> 00:43:21,520
Governess Miao, please see him off.

617
00:43:22,880 --> 00:43:24,120
Farewell.

618
00:43:24,200 --> 00:43:25,880
How great.

619
00:43:25,960 --> 00:43:28,560
Zhuo finally woke up.

620
00:43:29,320 --> 00:43:33,000
This feels like a dream.

621
00:43:34,960 --> 00:43:36,160
Young child,

622
00:43:36,800 --> 00:43:38,360
it's all thanks to you.

623
00:43:38,960 --> 00:43:39,800
Back then,

624
00:43:39,880 --> 00:43:42,520
Lu Zhuo had fallen into a coma
for days without any sign of waking.

625
00:43:43,120 --> 00:43:45,240
Even the imperial physicians were stumped.

626
00:43:45,320 --> 00:43:47,880
I had no choice

627
00:43:47,960 --> 00:43:50,560
but to beg for a marriage
to turn over his luck.

628
00:43:51,480 --> 00:43:52,520
Given the circumstances,

629
00:43:52,600 --> 00:43:55,480
no one wanted to marry
their daughter off like that.

630
00:43:55,560 --> 00:43:57,200
But Old Madam Wei

631
00:43:57,280 --> 00:44:00,160
was kind enough.
She learned of our hardship,

632
00:44:00,240 --> 00:44:03,000
and you're generous enough
to agree to this marriage.

633
00:44:03,920 --> 00:44:07,640
I will always remember
this kindness from you.

634
00:44:08,440 --> 00:44:10,480
Yes, Rao.

635
00:44:10,560 --> 00:44:12,280
You are a blessing to the Lu family.

636
00:44:13,040 --> 00:44:16,160
Lu Zhuo will treat you with love and care.

637
00:44:16,240 --> 00:44:18,240
He will repay your favor.

638
00:44:18,840 --> 00:44:21,000
His Lordship is blessed by the gods.

639
00:44:21,080 --> 00:44:22,640
It is not my doing at all.

640
00:44:23,240 --> 00:44:24,680
However, His Lordship just woke up.

641
00:44:24,760 --> 00:44:25,960
He is quite weak now.

642
00:44:26,040 --> 00:44:28,600
Why don't all of you rest now?

643
00:44:29,280 --> 00:44:31,120
I shall look after His Lordship.

644
00:44:31,200 --> 00:44:33,040
Under the guidance of Governess Miao,

645
00:44:33,560 --> 00:44:34,920
I'm sure nothing will go wrong.

646
00:44:35,680 --> 00:44:36,800
Sure.

647
00:44:36,880 --> 00:44:41,920
Anyway, we can always talk
once Lu Zhuo makes a full recovery. Come.

648
00:44:42,000 --> 00:44:43,360
Thank you so much.

649
00:44:43,440 --> 00:44:44,520
Let's go.

650
00:44:50,000 --> 00:44:51,440
Farewell.

651
00:45:28,560 --> 00:45:31,720
Turning over my luck? That's nonsense.

652
00:45:32,520 --> 00:45:34,120
I woke up

653
00:45:38,000 --> 00:45:39,840
because it's not my time to die yet.

654
00:45:40,640 --> 00:45:41,880
As to you,

655
00:45:42,600 --> 00:45:44,280
you venomous, treacherous woman.

656
00:45:44,360 --> 00:45:46,520
Who are you after this time?

657
00:45:50,160 --> 00:45:51,240
Jiede.

658
00:45:52,440 --> 00:45:53,600
Jiede.

659
00:45:58,400 --> 00:45:59,560
Your Lordship.

660
00:46:00,160 --> 00:46:01,440
Bring my servant here.

661
00:46:05,320 --> 00:46:07,120
Now!

662
00:46:11,160 --> 00:46:14,440
Compared to Your Lordship's thoroughness,
I sure am short-sighted.

663
00:46:15,600 --> 00:46:16,440
Bitao,

664
00:46:16,960 --> 00:46:18,080
His Lordship will often need to see

665
00:46:18,160 --> 00:46:20,000
the physician and the male servants.

666
00:46:20,080 --> 00:46:21,280
The female servants in
the rear court will be an inconvenience.

667
00:46:22,040 --> 00:46:24,600
Therefore, he will move
to the study to recuperate.

668
00:46:24,680 --> 00:46:27,480
Inform Governess Miao of that decision
and tell her to inform Old Madam as well.

669
00:46:27,560 --> 00:46:29,760
Then, tell Jiede in the study
in the front court

670
00:46:29,840 --> 00:46:33,080
to bring several attentive helpers
with him tomorrow morning.

671
00:46:34,040 --> 00:46:35,080
Yes.

672
00:46:46,000 --> 00:46:47,960
Old Madam and Mother prayed so hard

673
00:46:48,880 --> 00:46:50,040
for you to wake up.

674
00:46:50,120 --> 00:46:52,720
Your Lordship, it is imperative
that you take good care of yourself.

675
00:46:52,800 --> 00:46:54,080
Avoid emotional outbursts

676
00:46:54,680 --> 00:46:56,440
lest the elderly worry about you.

677
00:46:56,520 --> 00:46:57,960
You don't want to be unfilial, do you?

678
00:46:58,720 --> 00:47:00,800
Not only are you a venomous snake,

679
00:47:01,320 --> 00:47:03,080
you are also a hypocritical snake

680
00:47:03,960 --> 00:47:06,200
with a silver tongue.

681
00:47:07,240 --> 00:47:08,200
Get away from me!

682
00:49:22,480 --> 00:49:24,400
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
